      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::hypothesis_evidence_v2::9f4bbbcfd9d4efc4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitates will specifically include HfSi2 or ZrSi2.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The silicides will form a discrete reticulated network within the BCC matrix.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The reticulated silicide network will occur at both grain boundaries and grain interiors.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The silicide network will force cracks to deflect, branch, or arrest.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crack deflection and branching will increase fracture-surface area and energy absorption.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed network will improve room-temperature ductility and fracture toughness.",
